<title>USA: Brazil's Copene Q1 net income falls.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Copene Q1 net income falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> ADR			  $0.23		    $1.09</p>
<p> Net			  8,300		   38,900</p>
<p> Revs		     328,100		  334,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Results shown in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>Revenues are gross revenues. Q1 net sales: $277.1 million vs $283.5 million.</p>
<p>Net earnings per 1,000 shares: $4.65 vs $21.71.</p>
<p>All figures inflation adjusted to purchasing power of the Brazilian real as of March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>Copene is a Brazilian petrochemical products producer.</p>
</text>
